<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_6__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this Act, a trade description or statement published in any newspaper, book or periodical or in any film or sound or television broadcast or any other medium, including through electronic means, shall not be deemed to be a trade description or a statement unless it is or forms part of an advertisement. False trade description"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
