<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A false trade description is a trade description which is false to a material degree."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A trade description which, though not false, is misleading, that is to say, likely to be taken for an indication of any of the matters specified in section 6 as would be false to a material degree, is deemed to be a false trade description."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
