<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Anything which, though not a trade description, that is to say, likely to be taken for an indication of any of the matters specified in section 6 as would be false to a material degree, is deemed to be a false trade description."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
