<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "If in any case the defence involves the allegation that the commission of the offence was due to a mistake on his part or to reliance on information supplied to him or to the act or default of another person, the person charged shall not, without leave of the Court, be entitled to rely on that defence unless, within a period of fourteen days of his being charged in Court, he has served on the prosecutor a notice in writing giving such information as was then in his possession identifying or assisting in the identification of that other person."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
