<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "In any proceedings for an offence of supplying or offering to supply goods to which a false trade description is applied, it shall be a defence for the person charged to prove that he did not know, and could not with reasonable diligence have ascertained, that the goods did not conform to the description or that the description had been applied to the goods."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
