<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "in relation to goods, the supply, including resupply, by way of sale, exchange, lease, hire or hire-purchase of the goods; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_I__cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
