<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_63__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An offer under subsection (1) may be made at any time after the offence has been committed but before any prosecution for it has been instituted, and where the amount specified in the offer is not paid within the time specified in the offer, or such extended time as the Controller may grant, prosecution for the offence may be instituted at the expiry of the time stipulated in the offer against the person to whom the offer was made."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/16/eng@> .
